          <h2 class="section-title">Contested environments demand capture-resistant infrastructure</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>Modern defence operations extend far from fixed data centres. Forward-deployed units, border surveillance systems, and intelligence collection platforms operate in environments where network connectivity is intermittent, denied, or actively contested. In these conditions, computing devices may fall into adversarial hands — and the data they contain must remain protected under any scenario.</p>
          <p>MEAICON designs secure edge computing and sovereign compute platforms that address this reality. Security is enforced at the hardware level, not by policy alone. From TPM 2.0 root of trust through secure boot, anti-tamper protection, and remote zeroization, every layer is engineered to maintain operational integrity and protect mission data regardless of physical custody.</p>
